WEBVTT

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:41.620
Whoa, whoa!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:44.870
Hi, Mom! Dad!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.880
Hey, Tina, you can take a tea break with sweets.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:49.830
Yes, Mom!

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.430
Tina!

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:00.910
Whoa, whoa!

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.040
That was surprising.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.770
Ah, you little!

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.380
Huh? You're reading a book!

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.090
I thought you were playing a game.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.880
Ah! Well, without Tina Nee-chan here, it's boring.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.350
I see.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.420
Recently, cleaning has been easy, too.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.620
Since there's no one to litter everywhere.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:50.850
She's so late.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.450
When will Tina Nee-chan's come home.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:06.490
Kaoru-sama!

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.540
Ah!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.470
Kaoru-sama, this is...

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:11.980
Tina.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:29.190
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, sorry about this,
please take care of Uzume.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.430
I've been away a long time.

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:34.700
And need to spend quality time with my papa and mama.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.130
So I might be there awhile.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.870
Kaoru-sama, Tina-san is...

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.870
She'll come back. It'll be fine.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.480
Tina-san.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.210
Aoi-chan.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:00.840
Ah!

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.500
Kaoru-sama.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.220
Pickles?

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.500
Yes.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.070
There were fresh turnips available.

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:11.400
I see.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.020
Tina-san loves pickled turnips, so...

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.940
It's already March.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.070
It's time for Tina-san's graduation ceremony, yet...

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.120
It couldn't be that she won't...

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.620
Let's try contacting her then.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:37.340
Eh!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:40.340
Let's ask Tina directly.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.640
I messed up.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.570
This is difficult.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.780
Oh, well...

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:18.130
All right, I'll try one more time.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.880
It's no use.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.970
Kaoru-sama.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.380
Let's try calling her house.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.370
But we don't know the number.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.980
We might find it in Tina's room.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.570
I feel awkward just going in, but...

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.830
Tina-san, excuse us.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.330
Huh!

00:05:58.480 --> 00:05:59.600
This is...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.250
Kaoru-sama.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.940
Kaoru-sama, what exactly is this?

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:09.640
I see.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.510
She left her memories behind.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.380
Eh!

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.390
Aoi-chan.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.980
Tina might never come back here again.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.450
Never come back.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.570
Tina-san won't ever...

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.870
That can't be...

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:35.900
No way.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.010
That's...

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.120
That's...

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:47.980
Tina!

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.270
All right!

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.110
Okay.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.550
There.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.900
They're ready to eat.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:47.820
Huh!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.790
Okay, I'll take care of the rest!

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.060
I'm sorry.

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.320
Please take care of it.

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:58.060
Oh no, I'm so careless.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.290
Huh? What's wrong?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:05.250
Ah, I forgot that we were out of soy sauce...

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.710
I'm going shopping for a bit.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:10.440
Aoi-chan.

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:11.300
Yes?

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.380
Let's go together.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.370
Okay.

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:25.520
Ah, Miyabi-san.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.060
Japanese food again today?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.460
Yes.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:33.030
Aoi-san said it's so Tina-senpai
can come back at any time.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.410
I see.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.660
When is the graduation ceremony again?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.470
Eh?!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.570
Ah, the college's?

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:41.970
Um...

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.740
It's the day after tomorrow.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.210
Oh, no!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.540
I wonder if Tina-senpai forgot!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.260
The day after tomorrow!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.550
Or maybe she's planning on
not being in the ceremony?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.250
Who knows?! But first...

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.490
Yes?

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:57.720
It's boiling over.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:58.390
Hm!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:01.310
Hot!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.530
H-Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:06.940
Things are bustling here even without Tina-san.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.360
That was so hot!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.070
Heh!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.860
This is very well made.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.510
It's embarrassing.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.540
Would you make one for me, too?

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:20.880
Sure, no problem.

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:22.700
Once I'm done with that one, okay?

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.850
You can finish this one later.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.330
We don't know when she'll come back, after all.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.550
Eh? But...

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:32.800
Honestly.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.960
To return to America and not even contact us once.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:40.720
Does she even know how
much everyone misses her?

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.400
Huh?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.230
Do you miss her, too, Mayu Nee-chan?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:47.840
Heh? Ah, n-no, not me.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:52.610
That is, you're making this doll
because you miss her, right?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:59.080
The truth is that you love her,
don't you, Mayu Nee-chan?

00:09:59.080 --> 00:09:59.950
Isn't that right?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.780
T-That's not it.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.820
Who could ever love a beast woman like her?

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:10.290
Here.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.880
I have nothing against this doll, after all.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.260
Heh! My heart was racing.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.150
Aoi-chan.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:35.940
Ah, yes? I'm sorry for being so absent-minded.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.360
Will you come with me for a bit?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:39.320
Eh!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.200
Wow!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.730
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:52.790
Tina said that this was her favorite place.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.380
Eh!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.880
She said that the scenery was similar to America.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.770
I've been thinking since then.

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.470
About Tina.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.390
She couldn't say anything because she's so kind.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:15.990
If staying in America is what's
good for Tina from here on,

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.030
then, we need to support her.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:23.820
Tina-san's future!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.240
You're right.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:34.810
Let's go home. We need to tell everyone.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:35.210
Yes.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:50.980
Tina!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.100
Tina-san!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.400
I'm home!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.940
Huh! It's Tina Nee-chan!

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.370
Welcome home!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.030
Oh, Chika-rin!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.980
Uzume, it's been a while!

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.450
Well now, you did come back.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.220
It had finally gotten peaceful here.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.980
Huh?! What does that mean, you little brat?

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.500
It's been a while, so I'm gonna...

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.960
Tina-san, please be quiet.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:17.840
Yes.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.740
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.660
Tina-san, how about some tea?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.020
T-Tea? You mean here?

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.580
Yes, once in a while...

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:05.300
Oh, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, it's because you were so rash.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.140
I'm sorry.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.110
I caused you problems.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.080
Yummy!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.080
The tea you make really is the best, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.020
Thank you very much.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.990
Ah, if you'd like this with your tea, then please.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.290
Oh, turnips!

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:26.590
Thanks for the food!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:32.330
Tasty!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.630
Thank goodness.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:37.100
Actually, I was planning on
serving them last night, though.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.500
But, things got so busy during
the <i>Welcome Home Party.</i>

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.940
Last night was so much fun.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.430
Huh?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:05.110
It's weird.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.730
Where did Tina Nee-chan go?

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:11.870
You guys came all this way to see her, yet...

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:14.710
Maybe she went out somewhere?

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:17.540
She said that she'd be in all day today.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.210
Let's search the second floor.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.250
Ah, that's...

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.050
Huh?!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.380
Yeah, I was looking at them again.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.560
You're making that face again.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:34.100
Well, I had never worn anything like that before.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:34.810
Eh!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.520
At my high school, I wore a hakama.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.600
Hakama?

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:51.240
Oh, that's great!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.740
I rather liked them, too.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.290
I also wonder if we had gone to the same school,

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:02.060
I would've become kind of like you, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.210
Eh!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.880
After all, you're the one I aspire to be like.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.410
Aspire?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.630
Yeah.

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.130
You're kind.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.770
You can do anything.

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.430
It feels like you're a lady among ladies.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.810
Ever since I met you, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}...

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.610
I've always thought I'd like
to become a lady like you.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.900
You have?

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:32.720
Well, even if I didn't make
the effort, I always felt that way.

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.350
Well, indeed I'm unrefined, though.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.560
N-No, that's not it.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:40.330
Compared to you, Tina-san, I...

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.160
Heh!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:47.250
I actually, I've always
been jealous of you, Tina-san.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:47.800
Huh!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:52.270
You possess many qualities that I don't.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.110
You can do as you please.

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:58.560
You can entertain others,
no matter where you are.{A clown}

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:05.230
Every day, I think I'd like to be
a little more like you, Tina-san.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.620
Really, I didn't know that!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.490
I can't believe you felt that way, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:19.830
And I didn't know you looked
at me like that, Tina-san.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.710
Huh, there is Tina Nee-chan.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.980
Looks they're laughing.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:32.580
The two of them are good friends, aren't they?

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:33.680
Yeah.

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:36.850
Aoi Onee-chan and Tina Nee-chan are...

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:39.350
really good friends.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.390
Ah, right!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.720
Tomorrow is the graduation day, right?

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.650
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:49.320
If you'd like...

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.400
Eh?!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.470
Tina Nee-chan, you look cool!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:03.960
It really looks good on you, senpai!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.850
The clothes really do make the woman.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:09.500
What?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.350
Huh?!

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:11.550
You want to?

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.550
I'll take you on!

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:17.470
No matter what you say today, I won't get angry.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.230
Thank you, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.500
This will be the best graduation.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.030
I will never forget today, ever.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.810
Tina-san.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:35.970
Tina.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:48.920
To be honest, I originally
wasn't planning to come back.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.560
Eh!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.540
Tina.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:56.900
After I returned to America,
my mama and papa were so happy.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.550
So I thought it might be nice to live like this.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:02.640
But...

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.270
I love my papa and mama.

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:15.940
I love you and the Ooya-san{landlord}, too.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:19.620
I love everyone.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.710
And I thought about it.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:29.620
I thought about it.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:43.870
And I decided.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.810
To come back here.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:57.150
Here, I'm accepted for all that I am.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:01.450
Here, I can live as myself.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:05.370
Here, I'll be able to find my future.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.670
That's what I thought.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:08.500
Tina.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.370
Tina-san.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.380
Indeed, this place is special.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.340
I love this place and everyone.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:23.100
Although, I'm sure all this is just a big bother for you two.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.420
Welcome home.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:31.270
Welcome home, Tina.

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:33.030
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.150
Kaoru.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.230
Yeah.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.420
I'm home.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.160
I'm off!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.370
Have a good day!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:01.950
Kaoru-sama.

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:09.220
Everyone is going to live here and then leave, right?

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.300
Time can't be stopped.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:16.030
But someday, the time for this to end will come.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:22.810
But the wonderful times we spent
with everyone will never fade away.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:23.770
Aoi-chan.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:28.510
I will treasure this time.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:31.960
I'm grateful from the bottom
of my heart for these bonds.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.790
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.590
Thanks to these bonds, I'm the way I am.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:44.050
Because you and everyone
else are here, Aoi-chan, I...

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.660
Kaoru-sama.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.770
I have to do my best.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:54.440
I need to find my future here, too.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.350
Yes.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.570
In this place where we all are.

00:22:21.140 --> 00:22:21.900
I'm back home.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.760
Welcome home.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:26.690
Welcome home!
